// static_basic — the ws00 plumbing case: one static file, served
// byte-for-byte (modulo NORMALIZE). Request lines are RAW BYTES
// with CRLF endings (this file deliberately mixes line endings;
// see docs/DIFFERENTIAL.md). Expected reply generated against the
// pinned nginx/1.30.4 with the corpus mtime 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z.
--- request
GET /index.html HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1
Connection: close

--- expect
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Server: <normalized>
Date: <normalized>
Content-Type: text/html
Content-Length: 79
Last-Modified: Thu, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT
Connection: close
ETag: "6955b900-4f"
Accept-Ranges: bytes

<!doctype html>
<html><body>lobo differential case: static_basic</body></html>
